<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman cuts Motorola - source. [CORRECTED 14:33 GMT]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman cuts Motorola - source. [CORRECTED 14:33 GMT]</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs cut its rating on Motorola Inc to market perform from recommend, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Ajay Diwan (corrects name from Rajiv Chaudhri) was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- The stock was down 5/8 at 48-3/8.</p>
</text>
